sandbox-runtime (Rust)
Copyright 2026 defims and contributors

This project is a Rust implementation of the sandbox-runtime mechanism,
maintained as a line-level port of Anthropic's TypeScript project.

This product includes software developed as part of:

  sandbox-runtime
  https://github.com/anthropic-experimental/sandbox-runtime
  Copyright 2025 Anthropic
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The initial Rust implementation was based on the community port by
wangyedev (https://github.com/wangyedev/sandbox-runtime-rs), itself
derived from the Anthropic TypeScript project.

A reference snapshot of the upstream TypeScript sources is vendored in
srt_legacy_ts/ (Apache-2.0, see srt_legacy_ts/README.md for the pinned
version and commit).

The Windows helper crate is vendored verbatim from the same upstream
project in vendor/srt-win/ (Apache-2.0; see vendor/srt-win/PROVENANCE.md
for the pinned commit).

Modifications from the initial community port are recorded in
CHANGELOG.md.

